# Focused continuation from Slide 1038's terminal WayPoint 430 through the
# next rooftop cohort, WebGrabPoints 441/443, and Slide 1039.  The teleport is
# diagnostic setup only; post-crash-route-probe carries the finalized segment
# in uninterrupted player flow.
fixed_step_ms 25
sample_interval_ms 25
capture_interval_ms 0
max_time_ms 120000
start_time_ms 53033
render_size 1280 720

wait_gameplay 1000
teleport 4214 8558 2454 -1 0 0
wait_enemies_grounded 5000 618 10342 10343
capture room7-rooftop-encounter-ready
attack 70000 180 618 10342 10343
capture room7-rooftop-encounter-complete
move_until_state 3000 0 0 0

# The landing roof ends at x=2939; the adjacent 2612 cm roof begins there
# one storey higher.  Use an ordinary jump before approaching point 441.
move_to 3050 8450 2454 100 6000
jump
move_to 2600 8450 2612 200 6000
move_until_state 3000 0 0 0
move_to 2250 7800 2612 100 4000
capture room7-web441-takeoff
jump
wait 100
web_on
move_until_state 2500 0 0 18
capture room7-web441-swing
move_until_state 3000 0 0 19
capture room7-web441-release

# Point 441's automatic exit crosses the first gap.  Once motion 19 returns
# to ordinary airborne state 15, point 443 is the next facing-valid grab.
move_until_state 2500 0 0 15
web_on
move_until_state 2500 0 0 18
capture room7-web443-swing
move_until_state 3000 0 0 19
capture room7-web443-release

# Point 443 is authored with WayPoint 445, so motion 28 feeds Slide 1039
# without player-authored coordinates or a diagnostic teleport.
move_until_state 5000 0 0 23
capture room7-second-slide-catch
move_until_state 2000 0 0 22
assert_audio_played SFX_SLIDING
wait 2250
# Forced motion 28 hands its approximately 1219 cm/s arrival speed to
# CSlider, so this uninterrupted chain advances farther than the standalone
# 700 cm/s slide fixture after the same interval.
assert_near -5790 6699 1960 200
capture room7-second-slide-moving
# Native obbox::test_obb applies a world-space broad phase before volume 554's
# oriented containment test.  The slide stays outside that gate and reaches
# waypoint 446, directly above the adjoining roof.
move_until_state 5000 0 0 15
capture room7-second-slide-exit
move_until_state 2000 0 0 16
move_until_state 1000 0 0 0
capture room7-second-slide-landing
assert_health_above 0
finish
